# Accepted IaC findings. Each entry is a deliberate trade-off, reviewed and documented.

# EKS API endpoint is public so the operator can administer from any network during a
# short demo. Every request is still authenticated with IAM, and CI never calls the API
# (Argo CD pulls from Git). Narrow cluster_endpoint_public_access_cidrs to your IP.
AWS-0040
AWS-0041

# Worker nodes need outbound internet (via NAT) to pull images from GHCR and ECR.
AWS-0104

# ingress_mode = "hostport" only: worker nodes sit in public subnets with public IPs so
# Traefik can answer on port 8080 without a load balancer. The node security group admits
# only that port (plus EKS control-plane traffic). The default "nlb" mode keeps nodes private.
AWS-0164
